--------------------------------------------------------------------------
Our own work
--------------------------------------------------------------------------

Everything in this repository that is not listed below is covered by the
Apache License 2.0: the build script, the Calamares module configuration, the
installer branding, the nyx-tools helpers, the validation script, and the
logo generator.

The logo is original artwork. It is a crescent moon drawn as a stack of
horizontal bars and is produced entirely by scripts/make-logo.py; no part of it
is traced from, adapted from, or derived from any existing character, logo, or
raster. An earlier revision of this project used artwork adapted from a
third-party project as its mark. That artwork was removed, together with every
file generated from it, precisely because a distribution cannot redistribute
someone else's artwork as its own identity, and because doing so put the
project's branding on uncertain legal ground.

The braille wordmark in config/fastfetch/nyx.ascii is likewise original.

